---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../consts';
---

<StaticPage
  title="Contact"
  description={`Contact the ${SITE_NAME} newsroom with tips, corrections, and inquiries.`}
  canonicalPath="/contact/"
  updated="September 2026"
>
  <p>
    We welcome story tips, feedback, and corrections from our readers. Because
    our stories are produced from official U.S. government source data, the most
    useful tips are ones that point out a factual error or a source we may have
    missed.
  </p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>
    Spotted an error in a story? Please tell us — describe the story headline, the
    specific issue, and any supporting information. See our{' '}
    <a href="/corrections-policy/">Corrections Policy</a> for how we handle
    updates and corrections.
  </p>

  <h2>Editorial and general inquiries</h2>
  <p>
    For editorial questions, story tips, or general inquiries, please reach out
    through the corrections process above. A direct newsroom email address will
    be published on this page before the site is opened to search indexing.
  </p>

  <h2>Legal and privacy</h2>
  <p>
    For legal or takedown requests, or privacy inquiries, please use the same
    contact route. We will respond from an appropriate address.
  </p>
</StaticPage>
